{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, move to object. If object in range, take it and run tasks and check properties. Otherwise, scan area for objects. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    />",
